  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> be defined as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;Then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;increasing function in the interval</p>",
    "image": null
  },
